  "notes": "{当|あ}てはまる means that something fits, matches, or is applicable to a condition, category, or description.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{当|あ}てはめる→当てはめる：10213_atehameru⟧ (transitive — \"to apply something to\")\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{当|あ}てはまって⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates a continuing state of being applicable.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{条件|じょうけん}→条件：03285_jouken⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{当|あ}てはまる: to meet the conditions\n- ⟦{基準|きじゅん}→基準：00228_kijun⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{当|あ}てはまる: to meet the standard\n- ⟦ぴったり→ぴったり：02362_pittari⟧{当|あ}てはまる: to fit perfectly\n- すべて⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{当|あ}てはまる: to apply to everything\n\nUSAGE:\nThe particle pattern is A⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧B⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{当|あ}てはまる (A applies to B / A fits B). Often used in negative: {当|あ}てはまらない (doesn't apply).",
